{"tool_name":"legiolist","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"legiolist","home":"http://genolist.pasteur.fr/LegioList/","summary":"Legionella pneumophila genome database.","addition_date":"2015-09-30T13:41:12Z","last_update_date":"2024-11-25T14:27:22.109308Z","tool_type":["Database portal"],"collections":["DRCAT"],"biotools_curie":"biotools:legiolist","credit":[{"email":"adanchin@pasteur.fr","name":"Antoine Danchin","orcidid":"http://orcid.org/0000-0002-6350-5001","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Primary contact"]},{"email":"cbuch@pasteur.fr","name":"Carmen Buchrieser","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Primary contact"]},{"name":"DRCAT","typeEntity":"Project","typeRole":["Documentor"]},{"name":"Institut Pasteur","typeEntity":"Institute","typeRole":["Provider"]}],"documentation":[{"type":["General"],"url":"http://genolist.pasteur.fr/LegioList/help/infos.html"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"input":[{"data":{"term":"Gene symbol","uri":"http://edamontology.org/data_1026"}}],"operation":[{"term":"Query and retrieval","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0224"}],"output":[{"data":{"term":"Gene report","uri":"http://edamontology.org/data_0916"},"format":[{"term":"HTML","uri":"http://edamontology.org/format_2331"}]}]},{"input":[{"data":{"term":"Sequence accession (nucleic acid)","uri":"http://edamontology.org/data_1097"}}],"operation":[{"term":"Query and retrieval","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0224"}],"output":[{"data":{"term":"Gene report","uri":"http://edamontology.org/data_0916"},"format":[{"term":"HTML","uri":"http://edamontology.org/format_2331"}]}]}],"name":"Legionella pneumophila genome database","operating_system":["Linux","Mac","Windows"],"owner":"DRCAT","publication":[{"doi":"10.1099/13500872-141-2-261","metadata":{"abstract":"In the framework of the international collaborative project aiming to sequence the whole Bacillus subtilis chromosome, we have created a relational database for managing and analysing information associated with the molecular genetics of this bacterium: SubtiList. It allows recovery of non-redundant DNA sequences of the B. subtilis genome, as well as related information, i.e. genes, proteins, etc. A logical structure has been designed with appropriate links between the different objects, and a set of procedures has been implemented for data updating and management. The database is organized around a core constituted by all known contigs of B. subtilis, i.e. sets of non-redundant sequences created from original entries in the EMBL data library. A user-friendly interface has been developed to make the database easy to consult. Sequence analysis tools have been integrated into the database, such as a program for rapid similarity searching of protein data banks, and a powerful DNA pattern searching program. Thanks to the consistency of SubtiList, we have performed a codon usage analysis by Factorial Correspondence Analysis, and a study of the distribution of the isoelectric points of known proteins of B. subtilis. The SubtiList database is available through anonymous ftp (address 'ftp.pasteur.fr' or IP number 157.99.64.12,directory'/pub/GenomeDB/SubtiList').","authors":[{"name":"Danchin A."},{"name":"Glaser P."},{"name":"Moszer I."}],"citationCount":173,"date":"1995-01-01T00:00:00Z","journal":"Microbiology","title":"SubtiList: A relational database for the Bacillus subtilis genome"},"pmid":"7704253","type":["Primary"]}],"topic":[{"term":"Model organisms","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0621"}],"validated":1},"bioschemas":{"name":"Legionella pneumophila genome database","home":"https://bio.tools/legiolist","summary":"Legionella pneumophila genome database.","tool_type":"sc:SoftwareApplication"},"oeb":{"metrics":[{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/biotools:legiolist/db/genolist.pasteur.fr","@license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","@nmsp":"biotools","@type":"metrics","deprecated":true,"pro